# topology.obligations — disposition for every `allium plan` obligation of topology.allium.
#   <id> => structural | test:<name> exercises=<symbol> | waived: <reason>
# The SP2 mode data path (the presets the sp2_mode node downloads) is unit-tested by
# tests/sp2modes_test.c. The node-reachability rules still need the KS topology exercised
# in a loaded driver (plan/0005) plus GoldLib hardware; those stay honestly waived.

# --- Spec-integrity (covered by the check/analyse lane) ---
config-default.sp2_mode_count     => test:test_sp2_mode_count exercises=Sp2ModeCount
enum-comparable.ControlKind       => structural
entity-fields.Node                => structural
entity-fields.Mixer               => structural
surface-actor.Topology            => structural
surface-provides.Topology         => structural

# --- Behavioural node-reachability (needs a loaded-driver KS harness + hardware) ---
rule-success.CoreNodeReachable        => waived: needs the KS topology exercised in a loaded driver (plan/0005 + GoldLib hardware)
rule-failure.CoreNodeReachable.1      => waived: needs the KS topology exercised in a loaded driver (plan/0005 + GoldLib hardware)
rule-success.Sp2NodeTracksHardware    => waived: needs the KS topology exercised in a loaded driver (plan/0005 + GoldLib hardware)
rule-failure.Sp2NodeTracksHardware.1  => waived: needs the KS topology exercised in a loaded driver (plan/0005 + GoldLib hardware)
rule-success.SurroundResolves         => waived: needs the KS topology exercised in a loaded driver (plan/0005 + GoldLib hardware)
